@startuml ansispire-audit-selfheal-as-built
title Audit + Self-Heal — AS-BUILT, 2026-07-12
caption Implemented + e2e-tested (docker stack, TASK-001). Only the enabled remediation rule is shown.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

|Semaphore|
start
:task runs, emits events;
|Relay (relay.py)|
:cursor-paginated pull /api/events\n(resumable, heartbeat 60s);
|Sink (sink.py)|
:receive → append to **events.jsonl**\n(append-only, non-repudiation);
|Reactor (reactor.py v2.3)|
:tail events.jsonl · match rules.json;
if (event matches an **enabled** rule\nAND cooldown elapsed?) then (yes)
  :resolve template_name → id · **Bearer** auth;
  |Semaphore|
  :trigger remediation template (Task API)\ne.g. **Auto Remediation: Disk Cleanup**;
  :run disk_cleanup.yml → emits events\n(loop is auditable end-to-end);
  stop
else (no)
  |Reactor (reactor.py v2.3)|
  :ignore / suppress (cooldown or no rule);
  stop
endif

note right
  Excluded from AS-BUILT:
  - "DB Connection Failure" rule — enabled=false,
     db_failover.yml is a placeholder (TASK-008).
end note
@enduml
